---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Our Team
description: "The people behind the Office of Global Engagement: leadership, staff and the faculty liaisons who lead global practicums, May Term courses and partnerships."
eyebrow: About OGE
lede: "Office leadership, staff and the faculty liaisons who lead each global program work together to support students, faculty and partners around the world."
permalink: /about/team/
breadcrumbs:
  - label: About
    url: /about/
---
{% include "components/page-hero.njk" %}

{# ---------- Leadership ---------- #}
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="leadership-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section__head">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Leadership</p>
        <h2 class="section__title" id="leadership-title">Office leadership</h2>
      </div>
      <a class="section__more" href="/about/leadership/">Full leadership profiles</a>
    </div>
    <div class="people-grid">
      {% for p in team.leadership %}
        <article class="person">
          {% if p.photo %}
            <img class="person__photo" src="{{ p.photo }}" alt="" loading="lazy">
          {% else %}
            <span class="person__initials" aria-hidden="true">{{ p.initials }}</span>
          {% endif %}
          <div>
            <h3 class="person__name"><a href="{{ p.url }}">{{ p.name }}</a></h3>
            <p class="person__title">{{ p.title }}</p>
            {% if p.secondaryTitle %}<p class="person__subtitle">{{ p.secondaryTitle }}</p>{% endif %}
            {% if p.email %}<p class="person__contact"><a href="mailto:{{ p.email }}">{{ p.email }}</a></p>{% endif %}
          </div>
        </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ---------- Staff ---------- #}
<section class="section section--sand" aria-labelledby="staff-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section__head">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Staff</p>
        <h2 class="section__title" id="staff-title">Office staff</h2>
        <p class="section__intro">Staff coordinate research, partnership agreements, communications and events for the office.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="people-grid">
      {% for p in team.staff %}
        <article class="person">
          {% if p.photo %}
            <img class="person__photo" src="{{ p.photo }}" alt="" loading="lazy">
          {% else %}
            <span class="person__initials" aria-hidden="true">{{ p.initials }}</span>
          {% endif %}
          <div>
            <h3 class="person__name"><a href="{{ p.url }}">{{ p.name }}</a></h3>
            <p class="person__title">{{ p.title }}</p>
            {% if p.secondaryTitle %}<p class="person__subtitle">{{ p.secondaryTitle }}</p>{% endif %}
            {% if p.bio %}<p class="person__bio">{{ p.bio }}</p>{% endif %}
            {% if p.focus and p.focus.length %}
              <ul class="tag-list person__focus" aria-label="Areas of focus">
                {% for f in p.focus %}<li class="tag">{{ f }}</li>{% endfor %}
              </ul>
            {% endif %}
            {% if p.email %}<p class="person__contact"><a href="mailto:{{ p.email }}">{{ p.email }}</a></p>{% endif %}
          </div>
        </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ---------- Faculty liaisons ---------- #}
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="liaisons-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section__head">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Faculty</p>
        <h2 class="section__title" id="liaisons-title">Faculty liaisons &amp; program leads</h2>
        <p class="section__intro">Each global practicum site, May Term course and partnership is led by a faculty member. Have questions about a specific agency or program? Reach out to the faculty liaison associated with that program.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="section__more" href="/education/practicum/">Global practicum sites</a>
    </div>
    <div class="people-grid people-grid--3">
      {% for p in team.facultyLiaisons %}
        <article class="person">
          {% if p.photo %}
            <img class="person__photo" src="{{ p.photo }}" alt="" loading="lazy">
          {% else %}
            <span class="person__initials" aria-hidden="true">{{ p.initials }}</span>
          {% endif %}
          <div>
            <h3 class="person__name"><a href="{{ p.url }}">{{ p.name }}</a></h3>
            <p class="person__title">{{ p.title }}</p>
            {% if p.programs and p.programs.length %}
              <ul class="tag-list person__focus" aria-label="Programs">
                {% for prog in p.programs %}<li class="tag tag--initiative">{{ prog }}</li>{% endfor %}
              </ul>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ---------- Work with us ---------- #}
<section class="section section--sand" aria-labelledby="work-title">
  <div class="container split">
    <div class="flow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Work with us</p>
      <h2 class="mt-0" id="work-title">Faculty and staff: propose a global initiative</h2>
      <p>OGE leads, supports and coordinates the School's global engagement initiatives. If you are a faculty or staff member with an idea for an international research collaboration, a faculty-led course, a visiting scholar exchange or a new practicum site, the office can help you scope the project, identify partners and coordinate with Texas Global.</p>
      <p>Global research and initiative inquiries go to Associate Dean Noël Busch-Armendariz at <a href="mailto:nbusch@austin.utexas.edu">nbusch@austin.utexas.edu</a>. For practicum placements and student exchange, contact Assistant Dean Tanya Voss.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="flow">
      <ol class="steps">
        <li>
          <h3>Share your idea</h3>
          <p>Tell us about the partner, the place and the students or faculty you hope to involve.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Plan together</h3>
          <p>We help align the initiative with the School's three pillars of education, research and service and connect you with the right campus offices.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Launch and share</h3>
          <p>Once underway, we feature your work in Global Stories and events so the whole School community can learn from it.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
      <div class="btn-row mt-0">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/connect/">Contact the office</a>
        <a class="btn btn--outline" href="/connect/listserv/">Join the listserv</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "components/cta-band.njk" %}
